{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/falla-tipo/falla",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "es": "falla",
    "en": "fault"
  },
  "definition": {
    "es": "Superficie discreta, o zona de superficies discretas, con un cierto espesor, que separa dos cuerpos rocosos y a lo largo de la cual uno de los cuerpos se ha deslizado con respecto al otro.",
    "en": "A discrete surface, or zone of discrete surfaces, with some thickness, separating two rock masses across which one mass has slid past the other and characterized by brittle deformation."
  },
